B.bxW=s(["Pri total premye enskripsyon an. Kite vid pou itilize pri renouv\xe8lman an.","Prix total de la premi\xe8re inscription. Vide : m\xeame prix que le renouvellement.","Total first registration price. Leave blank to use the renewal price."],t.s)
B.bMH=s(["Im\xe8l obligatwa pou resevwa konfimasyon enskripsyon ak renouv\xe8lman yo.","Email requis pour recevoir les confirmations d\u2019inscription et de renouvellement.","Email required for registration and renewal confirmations."],t.s)
