B.bFY=s(["Navigat\xe8 a pa ofri depo lokal ki fyab. S\xe8vi ak yon navigat\xe8 ki ajou, san m\xf2d prive.","Le navigateur ne fournit pas de stockage local fiable. Utilisez un navigateur \xe0 jour, hors navigation priv\xe9e.","The browser does not provide reliable local storage. Use an up-to-date browser outside private mode."],t.s)
